# The semantic index — a build artifact regenerated by `npm run build:index`.
#
# prepack does NOT rebuild it (that needs the native stack plus the embedding
# model, and packing stays zero-native): it VERIFIES a present index against
# the committed agent-index.json's source digests and refuses to ship a stale
# one. A pack from a fresh clone therefore produces a catalog-only tarball,
# which is a supported shape — the default web engine needs no index at all.
index.db
index.db-wal
index.db-shm
index.meta.json
